<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37538" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξομοι-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make quite like, assimilate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εἶδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτὸν τῇ πολιτείᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					512e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τοὺς καρπούς</span>
			<i>produce</i> fruit <i>exactly like,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.2.4
			</span></i>; <i>adapt,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἤθεσι τῶν λεγόντων καὶ τῶν
					ἀκουόντων τοὺς λόγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
					<u>Oxy.</u>
					1012i
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>; <i>compare, liken,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.5.22
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.11
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>become</i> or <i>be like,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρας γυναιξὶν ἐξομοιοῦσθαι φύσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					354
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				549
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				7.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Ἄψος σχῆμα ἐ. πρὸς τὸν Πηνειόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Flam.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
